# The upstream builds the `simulator` job of checks.yml tests against. Each value is a 40-hex commit or a release
# tag; the job fetches either. This file is outside the scorer's files (harness/, orchestrator/, schemas/,
# requirements-ci.txt: orchestrator/baseline/test_contracts_current.py), so moving a pin does not make a committed
# contract stale.
# The baseline rescore passes --sim v0.16.0 and does not read this file.

# inference-sim: its M3.1 integration head (m3/m31-integration-sim) after the final re-pin, #2252. Its stack.json
# pins blis-substrate b6748ca9d757, blis-vllm af87ac53acaf, blis-sglang 03d72d6fc3bf and the router 601ff6e9d37d.
SIM_REF=d2a6cc04ab7f38b1cddb662a78ded9831609fed3
# blis-substrate: its M3.1 integration head (m3/m31-integration), the commit the sim's stack.json names; the
# point-record, router-bound and ledger tests read it.
# (docs/m2/h200-v033/pins.env keeps the v0.14.0 commit: freeze_rows checks a checkout's commit).
SUBSTRATE_REF=b6748ca9d757f149ba760cf821f96feed3bbf5bf
# llm-d-router fork: its M3.1 integration head (m3/m31-integration-router), which publishes reference-configs/.
ROUTER_REF=601ff6e9d37def64fd2acd8cfb308b089a844f77
